<item><title>Algeria loses two more players to injury before Togo match</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/algeria-loses-two-more-players-to-injury-before-togo-match-7a6dee/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tg/algeria-loses-two-more-players-to-injury-before-togo-match-7a6dee/</guid><category>Togo</category><description>The Algerian football federation announced on Thursday, November 12, 2026, that Amin Chiakha and Rafik Belghali are out with injuries.</description><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 16:50:18 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tg.jpg" length="29610" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
